simo asterisco la cui specifica si trova 670 pagine (bianche) dopo e recita: “no, non abbiamo duettato a Sanremo, peró abbiamo registrato un episodio del suo podcast IL RIFF e chiacchierando di un sacco di cose mi ha anche chiesto se avessi tutti i numeri di telefono del mondo chi vorrei chiamare, ma per sapere cosa ho risposto dovete andare su @spotifyitaly e ascoltare la puntata”.", "user": {"strong_id__": "15526265", "pk": "15526265", "pk_id": "15526265", "id": "15526265", "is_unpublished": false, "fbid_v2": "17841401147950242", "username": "camihawke", "full_name": "Camihawke", "is_private": false, "is_verified": true, "profile_pic_id": "3599963566846179660_15526265", "profile_pic_url": "https://scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.2885-19/487361057_684224477284393_7381724342902909070_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s150x150_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6InByb2ZpbGVfcGljLmRqYW5nby43MTkuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=scontent-mxp2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=1&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gGQHzWUR03cKhqaxb7e-YfJxvUs5LeP37NOyq-ML_3VKn4JYyooWafIwMpu3snbKto&_nc_ohc=HHEghLUzHLcQ7kNvwEy0YwI&_nc_gid=P6_ZEbZx33TnGPC21m9cCQ&edm=ALQROFkBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Af-R80ARU1F4rXWhSklHCZFKkRr_z2yM3Hq7jiZD_0l59Q&oe=6A266AEC&_nc_sid=fc8dfb"}, "is_covered": false, "private_reply_status": 0, "text_translation": "I haven't told Marco yet, but I think that from today on in my CV as work experiences I will enter in the first place DUET with @mengonimarcoofficial followed by a very small asterisk whose specification is 670 pages (white) later and reads: \"no, we didn't duet in Sanremo, but we recorded a episode of his podcast IL RIFF and chatting about a lot of things he also asked me if I had all the phone numbers in the world who I would like to call, but to know what I answered you have to go to @spotifyitaly and listen to the episode."}, "comment_count": 180, "can_view_more_preview_comments": false, "preview_comments": [], "comment_likes_enabled": true, "shop_routing_user_id": null, "featured_products": [], "user": {"strong_id__": "1